      "statement_id": "DN3420-001-0001",
      "statement_ref": "DN 3420-001, Sec 1",
      "statement_text": "This Departmental Notice (DN) guides all United States Department of Agriculture (USDA) Mission Areas, agencies, and staff offices on updating cybersecurity Departmental directives and their local procedures. This DN requires Mission Areas, agencies, and staff offices to update their policy documents to align with the most recent release of the related authoritative references, as directed by Departmental Regulation (DR) 0100-001, Departmental Directives System. These authorities include enacted legislation or rules in the Federal Register, Executive Orders, Office of Management and Budget (OMB) and Department of Homeland Security (DHS) cybersecurity directives, or guidance from the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST).",
